Package: decisionRubricR
Title: Scoring and Validation Rubric for AI Decision Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Amar", "Ahmad", email = "amar.ahmad@nyu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities for scoring, validating, and visualizing
    AI decision-making models based on calibration, discrimination, and
    net-benefit metrics. Includes a reproducible Shiny demo and helper
    functions for recalibration and student rubric scoring.
